      "SponsorFirstPaymentRefundHtmlDocumentTitle": "Deposit refund",
      "SponsorFirstPaymentRefundBodyVendor": "Dear <span dir=\"auto\" style=\"unicode-bidi: isolate;\">{{.VendorName}}</span><br /><br />Unfortunately your second payment for <span dir=\"auto\" style=\"unicode-bidi: isolate;\">{{.ItemType}}</span> (<span dir=\"auto\" style=\"unicode-bidi: isolate;\">{{.ItemName}}</span>) for <span dir=\"auto\" style=\"unicode-bidi: isolate;\">{{.FestivalName}}</span>, due on <span dir=\"ltr\">{{.DueDate}}</span>, did not go through, although several attempts were made.<br /><br />Your first payment of <span dir=\"ltr\">{{.FirstPayment}}</span> has been refunded to you, and your booking is now cancelled. If you would still like to participate, you are welcome to review the floor plan and choose from what is available.<br /><br />Please feel free to call us at <span dir=\"ltr\">1 (855) 552-1522</span> if you need any further assistance.",
